---
description: UI and navigation invariants for Open Hardware Control
globs: src/kraken_control.py,src/ui_layout.py,desktop_*.py,src/assets/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Preserve the compact modern PySide6 visual language unless a redesign is explicitly requested.
- Overview, Navigation customization and Help are permanent navigation anchors: never hide, delete or make them toggleable.
- Navigation reorder/visibility state must remain persistent and resettable to defaults.
- Preserve keyboard/accessibility behavior and avoid modal flows when an embedded workflow already exists.
- Keep UI code from inventing hardware capabilities; ask backend/capability layers instead.
